<title>USA: PVC Container Corp Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>PVC Container Corp Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>						    September 30,</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $13,130,765  $12,782,357</p>
<p> Income from Operations		626,874	575,391</p>
<p> Income before provisions for tax  539,728	381,303</p>
<p> Net Income				318,440	235,482</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  .05	    .03</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>  of shares of common stock	6,964,705    6,761,913</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
